    '2. What are you really good at professionally?\n' +
    '3. What are you not good at or not interested in doing professionally?\n' +
    '4. Who were your last five bosses, and how will they each rate your performance on a 1-10 scale when we talk to them?',
  screenshot: 'out/B001EL6RWY/pages/page-084.png'
