  text: '“My team and I didn’t pay much attention to the screening interview when we first started using your system. We did them, but we weren’t rigorous enough. We found we were spending far too much time with people we had brought in for the day who were clearly not a fit. We should have known better. We wasted a lot of time.”\n' +
