  text: 'That sparked our "What? How? Tell me more" curiosity. "What happened?" we asked.\n' +
    '"Well," he replied, "I guess it came down to this one board meeting. I was there with my CEO, and the board was giving him a hard time because we had fallen short on our sales numbers."\n' +
    '"What were the numbers?" we asked the former VP of sales.\n' +
    `"We were off our goal by 25 percent. The board was not happy. They really had my CEO squirming with all of their questions. He finally cracked under the pressure and said to the board, 'If we do not achieve our target this next quarter, we'll have to get a new VP of sales—meaning my job!'"\n` +
    '"What did you do?" we asked, sensing this was about to get interesting.\n' +
    `"Well," he said, "I looked him right in the eye and said, 'You know what? Your mother had a lot of foresight when she named you.'"\n` +
