    "A smile crept across our candidate's face. It was a loaded smile because we had learned earlier in his interview that he was most proud of leading his high school hockey team in penalty minutes.\n" +
    '"So what did you do?" we pushed.\n' +
    '"I hit him!"\n' +
    `Now our curiosity was killing us. We couldn't stop ourselves. "How did you hit him, exactly?" we asked.\n` +
    '"It was sort of an open-handed slap across the face, but I hit him pretty hard!"\n' +
    '"What happened then?" We were on the edge of our seats.\n' +
